    "media:imagetext": "Mll\nair wisconsin\nQUICK REFERENCE SCHEDULE\nEFFECTIVE JUNE 27, 1983\nair wisconsing\nThe World's\nQuietest Jetliner\njoins the\nAir Wisconsin\nFleet!\nMINNEAPOLIS/ST. PAUL\nMUSKEGON\n/\nAPPLETON\n/ELKHART/GOSHEN\nNEENAH/MENASHA\nBATTLE CREEK\nDETROIT\nCLEVELAND\nAKRON/CANTON\nPITTSBURGH\nOSHKOSH\nCHICAGO\nSOUTH BEND\nLAFAYETTE\nTOLEDO\nFORT WAYNE\nNow Air Wisconsin flies the new 146 jet\nfrom Chicago, Appleton, Akron/Canton,\nFort Wayne and Toledo... with more\njet service coming soon!\nFor more information, call Air Wisconsin or your Travel Agent.\nAIR WISCONSIN IS A CAB CERTIFICATED CARRIER\nSERVING PASSENGERS. AIR FREIGHT \u0026 U.S. MAIL",
